 <h3><u>Ay Shaame Gharibaan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Ay Shaame Gharibaan</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x9</font></p>
  <font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> 
   <ol>
    <li>Laashon se bhara dasht hai jhalte huwe khaimen . Hai Jhalti huwi rait pe sehme huwe bache (Ay Shame ghariban) x3 Bar Raige tapa girya-e-atfaale pareshaan. Ay shame gharibaan</li>
    <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p>
    <li>Who dekh mere sher ka laasha hai labe juu. Haan dhundh ke laade mujhe Abbas ke baazu (Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x3 Haan laasha-e-Abbas sare saahil-e-viraan Ay shame gharibaan</li>
    <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p>
    <li>Naazon se pale ghunja dahen gesuon waale, Lowta de mere ghar ko mere ghar ke ujaale (Ay shame gharibaan) x3 Sab gaif ke shud khana-e-man teera-o-viraan. Ay shame gharibaan</li>
    <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p>
    <li>Pohncha de lab-e-nehr Sakeena ki sada ko Baba ko bulaati hai kabhi apne chacha ko (Ay Shame Ghariban) x3 Aawaze Sakeena berasan barsare maidaan Ay Shame Ghariban </li>
    <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p>
    <li>Jaa dhundhe agar dhundh sake teri nagaahain Do chaand meri doob gaye dasht-e-balaa mein (Ay Shame Gharibaan) x3 As Aun-o-Mohammed shuda khaali chamanistaan Ay shame ghariban </li>
    <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p>
    <li>Aik teer ne cheda hai zara dekh yahan par Asgher ka ghala bhaai ka bazu dil-e-maadar (Ay shame gharibaan) x3 Amaaz shuda teer-e sitam Asgher-e-nadaan Ay shame Ghariban </li>
    <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p>
    <li>Maktool-e-jafaa teen shab-o-rowz ka pyaasa Mehroom kafan se hai Muhammad ka nawasa (Ay shame Ghariban) x3 Be ghoro kafan sibt-e-nabi barsare maidaan Ay shame Ghariban </li>
   </ol> <p>(Ay Shaame Gharibaan) x6</p> <p>Zainab ba aseeri passe aashoor raseeda, wawayla wawayla</p></font>
